where $n$ counts the parallel cables. The \qty{10}{\mm} assembly uses $n=2$, and the \qty{20}{\mm} assembly uses $n=6$. Each 19-strand cable has $A_c=\qty{1.51e-6}{\metre\squared}$ and $E=\qty{193e9}{\pascal}$ (\nolinkurl{MonoPam_mult.m}, function \texttt{Spr()}, lines 628--637). The evaluators obtain the spring rate through \nolinkurl{Spr(bpa_i)} (\texttt{minimizeFlxPin.m}, line 156). Series combination with the projected bracket compliance gives $k_{eq} = \left(k_{\hat{u},br}^{-1} + k_{ten}^{-1} + c_{b2}\right)^{-1}$ (\texttt{minimizeFlxPin.m}, lines 394--409).

